<p>See also: <a href="/wiki/Debuffs" title="Debuffs">Debuffs</a>
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Stack_Types">Stack Types</span></h2><div class="hatnote"><b>Note:</b> These terms are not officially used by the game and are used by the wiki for better classification and description of their behavior.</div>
<ul><li><b>Intensity buffs</b> are more effective depending on how many stacks of the buff are applied. These buffs typically are either permanent for the combat encounter or are consumed on the following turn.</li>
<li><b>Duration buffs</b> last for as many turns as there are stacks of the buff. At the end of the turn, the buff will decrement by one stack.</li>
<li><b>Counter buffs</b> activate when an event happens, such as taking damage or being inflicted with a debuff. With the exception of <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span>, counter buffs lose a stack each time they activate.</li>
<li>Buffs that do not stack are typically gained from Power cards and last the entire combat encounter.</li></ul>
<p><span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Regen" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Regen_Potion" title="Regen Potion"><img alt="Icon Regen.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/22px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/33px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Regen.png/44px-Icon_Regen.png?59dc78 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Regen_Potion" title="Regen Potion">Regen</a></span> is the ONLY buff with both <b>Intensity</b> and <b>Duration</b> stack types.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Buffs">Buffs</span></h2>
<p>Characters may obtain buffs they may not normally cannot access by means of <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Prismatic Shard" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Prismatic_Shard" title="Prismatic Shard"><img alt="PrismaticShard.png" src="/images/thumb/PrismaticShard.png/24px-PrismaticShard.png?3616d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PrismaticShard.png/36px-PrismaticShard.png?3616d3 1.5x, /images/thumb/PrismaticShard.png/48px-PrismaticShard.png?3616d3 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Prismatic_Shard" title="Prismatic Shard">Prismatic Shard</a></span> if it is obtained from a card.
</p>
