<span data-text="enemy"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spiker" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Shapes#Spiker" title="Shapes"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Shapes#Spiker" title="Shapes">Spiker</a></span></span>
