<td>If <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pen Nib" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pen_Nib" title="Pen Nib"><img alt="PenNib.png" src="/images/thumb/PenNib.png/24px-PenNib.png?3d858e" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PenNib.png/36px-PenNib.png?3d858e 1.5x, /images/thumb/PenNib.png/48px-PenNib.png?3d858e 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pen_Nib" title="Pen Nib">Pen Nib</a></span> is obtained before <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Red Skull" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull"><img alt="RedSkull.png" src="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/24px-RedSkull.png?69d859" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedSkull.png/36px-RedSkull.png?69d859 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedSkull.png/48px-RedSkull.png?69d859 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Red_Skull" title="Red Skull">Red Skull</a></span>, instead of the usual order of operation, the 2× applies first and then the +3 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.
