<p><span data-text="silent"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Doppelganger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Doppelganger" title="Doppelganger"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Rare.png?5a1724 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Doppelganger" title="Doppelganger">Doppelganger</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Flying Knee" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Flying_Knee" title="Flying Knee"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Attack Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Attack_Common.png?ba66ad 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Flying_Knee" title="Flying Knee">Flying Knee</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Outmaneuver" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Outmaneuver" title="Outmaneuver"><img alt="CardIcon Silent Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Silent_Skill_Common.png?711671 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Outmaneuver" title="Outmaneuver">Outmaneuver</a></span></span>
<span data-text="defect"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Charge Battery" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Common.png?667972 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Charge_Battery" title="Charge Battery">Charge Battery</a></span></span>
<span data-show="silent defect" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Gain X additional <span data-energy="silent"><span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@GE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="GreenEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/20px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/30px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 1.5x, /images/thumb/GreenEnergy.png/40px-GreenEnergy.png?38db59 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span></span><span data-energy="defect"><span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@BE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="BlueEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/20px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/30px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 1.5x, /images/thumb/BlueEnergy.png/40px-BlueEnergy.png?9ac3e7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span></span><span data-energy="all"><span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@CE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="ColorlessEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/20px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/30px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 1.5x, /images/thumb/ColorlessEnergy.png/40px-ColorlessEnergy.png?259ded 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span></span> next turn.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Can only be obtained by <a href="/wiki/Silent" title="Silent">Silent</a> and <a href="/wiki/Defect" title="Defect">Defect</a>.</li>
<li>Both types of Energized count as different buffs.</li></ul>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>-999 to 999
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Focus.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/60px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/90px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b><a href="/wiki/Focus" class="mw-redirect" title="Focus">Focus</a></b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="defect"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Biased Cognition" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Biased_Cognition" title="Biased Cognition"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png?a9e6d3" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Rare.png?a9e6d3 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Biased_Cognition" title="Biased Cognition">Biased Cognition</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Consume" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Consume" title="Consume"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Skill_Uncommon.png?12d106 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Consume" title="Consume">Consume</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Defragment" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Defragment" title="Defragment"><img alt="CardIcon Defect Power Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Defect_Power_Uncommon.png?d75e25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Defect_Power_Uncommon.png?d75e25 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Defragment" title="Defragment">Defragment</a></span> <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Data Disk" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Data_Disk" title="Data Disk"><img alt="DataDisk.png" src="/images/thumb/DataDisk.png/24px-DataDisk.png?52f6e1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/DataDisk.png/36px-DataDisk.png?52f6e1 1.5x, /images/thumb/DataDisk.png/48px-DataDisk.png?52f6e1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Data_Disk" title="Data Disk">Data Disk</a></span> <span class="inline-trigger potion-trigger" data-name="Focus Potion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/File:FocusPotion.png" class="image"><img alt="FocusPotion.png" src="/images/thumb/FocusPotion.png/24px-FocusPotion.png?950a2f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/FocusPotion.png/36px-FocusPotion.png?950a2f 1.5x, /images/thumb/FocusPotion.png/48px-FocusPotion.png?950a2f 2x" data-file-width="64" data-file-height="64" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Focus_Potion" title="Focus Potion">Focus Potion</a></span></span>
<span data-show="defect" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Increases (Decreases) the effectiveness of your <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Orbs</a> by X.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Exclusive to <a href="/wiki/Defect" title="Defect">Defect</a>.</li>
<li><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Dark" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><img alt="DarkOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/18px-DarkOrb.png?895273" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/27px-DarkOrb.png?895273 1.5x, /images/thumb/DarkOrb.png/36px-DarkOrb.png?895273 2x" data-file-width="82" data-file-height="82" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Dark" title="Dark"><span title="">Dark</span></a></span> Orbs gain more Evoke damage per turn with <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.</li>
<li><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Plasma" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><img alt="PlasmaOrb.png" src="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/18px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/27px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 1.5x, /images/thumb/PlasmaOrb.png/36px-PlasmaOrb.png?9fcfdb 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Plasma" title="Plasma"><span title="">Plasma</span></a></span> Orbs are unaffected by <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Focus" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs"><img alt="Icon Focus.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/22px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/33px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Focus.png/44px-Icon_Focus.png?abc930 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orbs" title="Orbs">Focus</a></span>.</li></ul>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>-999 to 999
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Mantra.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/60px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/90px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Mantra</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Prostrate" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Prostrate" title="Prostrate"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png?b56679" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Common.png?b56679 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Prostrate" title="Prostrate">Prostrate</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Devotion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Rare.png?61e8e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Rare.png?61e8e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion">Devotion</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Worship" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Worship" title="Worship">Worship</a></span> <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Pray" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Pray" title="Pray"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Pray" title="Pray">Pray</a></span> <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Damaru" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Damaru" title="Damaru"><img alt="Damaru.png" src="/images/thumb/Damaru.png/24px-Damaru.png?f61b25" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Damaru.png/36px-Damaru.png?f61b25 1.5x, /images/thumb/Damaru.png/48px-Damaru.png?f61b25 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Damaru" title="Damaru">Damaru</a></span></span>
<span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Whenever you gain 10 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span>, enter <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Exclusive to <a href="/wiki/Watcher" title="Watcher">Watcher</a>.</li>
<li>If a player gains more than 10 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span> at a single instance (only possible by 10+ stacks of <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Devotion" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Rare.png?61e8e4" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Power_Rare.png?61e8e4 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Devotion" title="Devotion">Devotion</a></span> in vanilla gameplay), none of it counts towards <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Brilliance" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png?444f95" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png?444f95 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance">Brilliance</a></span>'s damage increase.<br /></li>
<li>Up to 9 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span> stacks will carry over after the player enters <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>, so if more than 10 is gained at once, the extra <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span> is wasted.</li></ul>
</td>
<td>Counter
</td>
<td>Integer limit for <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Brilliance" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Attack Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png?444f95" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Attack_Rare.png?444f95 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Brilliance" title="Brilliance">Brilliance</a></span>, but resets at 10 for the purpose of <span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Divinity" data-sequel="1" title=""><a href="/wiki/Keywords#Stance" title="Keywords">Divinity</a></span>
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Barricade.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Barricade.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Barricade.png/60px-Icon_Barricade.png?f15865" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Barricade.png/90px-Icon_Barricade.png?f15865 1.5x, /images/Icon_Barricade.png?f15865 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Barricade</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="ironclad"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Barricade" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Barricade" title="Barricade"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Barricade" title="Barricade">Barricade</a></span></span>
<span data-text="enemy"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spheric Guardian" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spheric_Guardian#Spheric_Guardian" title="Spheric Guardian"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spheric_Guardian#Spheric_Guardian" title="Spheric Guardian">Spheric Guardian</a></span></span>
<span data-show="ironclad enemy" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td><span class="keyword-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Block" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><img alt="Icon Block.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/18px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="18" height="18" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/27px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Block.png/36px-Icon_Block.png?de9e7c 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Block" title="Block"><span title="">Block</span></a></span> is not removed at the start of your/its turn.
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Does not stack
</td>
<td>1
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Berserk.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Berserk.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Berserk.png/60px-Icon_Berserk.png?a202e0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Berserk.png/90px-Icon_Berserk.png?a202e0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Berserk.png/120px-Icon_Berserk.png?a202e0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Berserk</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="ironclad"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Berserk" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Berserk" title="Berserk"><img alt="CardIcon Ironclad Power Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Ironclad_Power_Rare.png?baa309 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Berserk" title="Berserk">Berserk</a></span></span>
<span data-show="ironclad" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>At the start of your turn, gain X <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@RE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="RedEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/20px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/30px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 1.5x, /images/thumb/RedEnergy.png/40px-RedEnergy.png?d820a5 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span>.
</td>
