</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Debuff coded as a buff to prevent <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Artifact" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact"><img alt="Icon Artifact.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/22px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/33px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Artifact.png/44px-Icon_Artifact.png?d7c3d0 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Artifact" title="Artifact">Artifact</a></span> / <span class="relic-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Orange Pellets" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets"><img alt="OrangePellets.png" src="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/24px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/36px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 1.5x, /images/thumb/OrangePellets.png/48px-OrangePellets.png?bbb2d1 2x" data-file-width="156" data-file-height="156" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Orange_Pellets" title="Orange Pellets">Orange Pellets</a></span> from overriding it.<br /></li>
<li>Deals 99999 HP loss; can be prevented with enough max HP, <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Buffer" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffer" title="Buffer"><img alt="Icon Buffer.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Buffer.png/22px-Icon_Buffer.png?9070ff" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Buffer.png/33px-Icon_Buffer.png?9070ff 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Buffer.png/44px-Icon_Buffer.png?9070ff 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Buffer" title="Buffer">Buffer</a></span>, and <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Intangible" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Intangible.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/22px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/33px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/44px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Intangible">Intangible</a></span> active; consumes Lizard Tail / Fairy in a Bottle.<br />
<ul><li>HP loss means even if <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Intangible" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Intangible" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Intangible.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/22px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/33px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Intangible.png/44px-Icon_Intangible.png?3d82d7 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Intangible">Intangible</a></span> reduces it to 1, it can’t be blocked.<br /></li></ul></li>
<li>Triggered by <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vault" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vault" title="Vault"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vault" title="Vault">Vault</a></span>.<br /></li>
<li>Internally called EndTurnDeath.</li></ul>
</td>
<td>Does not stack
</td>
<td>n/a
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_EnergizedBlue.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon EnergizedBlue.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_EnergizedBlue.png/60px-Icon_EnergizedBlue.png?b77fb8" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_EnergizedBlue.png/90px-Icon_EnergizedBlue.png?b77fb8 1.5x, /images/Icon_EnergizedBlue.png?b77fb8 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Collect</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Collect" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Collect" title="Collect">Collect</a></span></span>
<span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>At the start of your next X turns, put a <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Miracle" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle"><img alt="CardIcon Colorless Skill Common.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png/24px-CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Colorless_Skill_Common.png?9ab8b5 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Miracle" title="Miracle">Miracle+</a></span> in your hand.
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Duration
</td>
<td>1 to 999
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_DevaForm.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon DevaForm.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_DevaForm.png/60px-Icon_DevaForm.png?d5027d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_DevaForm.png/90px-Icon_DevaForm.png?d5027d 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_DevaForm.png/120px-Icon_DevaForm.png?d5027d 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div></div>
