<span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>At the start of your turn gain <span class="keyword-trigger" data-name="@PE" data-sequel="1"><img alt="PurpleEnergy.png" src="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/20px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="20" height="20" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/30px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 1.5x, /images/thumb/PurpleEnergy.png/40px-PurpleEnergy.png?bc09d7 2x" data-file-width="164" data-file-height="164" /></span> N times and increase this gain by X.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>X = number of Deva Forms played. Initially N = X; each turn N increases by X. Further plays increase both N and X by 1.</li>
<li>Triggered by <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vault" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vault" title="Vault"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vault" title="Vault">Vault</a></span>.</li></ul>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>Integer limit, but will not gain more than 999 Energy
</td></tr>
<tr>
