<span data-show="watcher" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>At the start of your turn, gain X <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span>.
</td>
<td>
<ul><li>Internally called DevotionPower.<br /></li>
<li>Triggered by <span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Vault" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Vault" title="Vault"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Rare.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Rare.png?ae356d 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Vault" title="Vault">Vault</a></span>.<br /></li>
<li>If you have more than 10 Devotion and 0 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mantra" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Buffs#Mantra" title="Buffs"><img alt="Icon Mantra.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/22px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/33px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Mantra.png/44px-Icon_Mantra.png?5ed5ac 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a class="mw-selflink-fragment" href="#Mantra">Mantra</a></span> before it triggers, it will trigger Divinity but not stack for Brilliance.</li></ul>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>Integer limit
</td></tr>
<tr>
