<p><span data-text="watcher"><span class="card-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Swivel" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Swivel" title="Swivel"><img alt="CardIcon Watcher Skill Uncommon.png" src="/images/thumb/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png/24px-CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="24" height="24" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/CardIcon_Watcher_Skill_Uncommon.png?9f496a 1.5x" data-file-width="32" data-file-height="32" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Swivel" title="Swivel">Swivel</a></span></span>
