</p>
</td>
<td>At the end of its turn, it gains X <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>Integer limit
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Thievery.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Thievery.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Thievery.png/60px-Icon_Thievery.png?a49b95" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Thievery.png/90px-Icon_Thievery.png?a49b95 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Thievery.png/120px-Icon_Thievery.png?a49b95 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Thievery</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="enemy"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Looter" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Thieves#Looter" title="Thieves"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Thieves#Looter" title="Thieves">Looter</a></span> and <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Mugger" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Thieves#Mugger" title="Thieves"><img alt="MonsterClear.png" src="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/22px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/33px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 1.5x, /images/thumb/MonsterClear.png/44px-MonsterClear.png?a8c7db 2x" data-file-width="96" data-file-height="96" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Thieves#Mugger" title="Thieves">Mugger</a></span></span>
<span data-show="enemy" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Steals X <a href="/wiki/Gold" title="Gold">Gold</a> whenever it attacks.
</td>
<td>
</td>
<td>Intensity
</td>
<td>Integer limit
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_TimeWarp.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon TimeWarp.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_TimeWarp.png/60px-Icon_TimeWarp.png?2c6fb1" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_TimeWarp.png/90px-Icon_TimeWarp.png?2c6fb1 1.5x, /images/Icon_TimeWarp.png?2c6fb1 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Time Warp</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="enemy"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Time Eater" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Time_Eater#Time_Eater" title="Time Eater"><img alt="Map-TimeEater.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/22px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/33px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-TimeEater.png/44px-Map-TimeEater.png?74ceb5 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Time_Eater#Time_Eater" title="Time Eater">Time Eater</a></span></span>
<span data-show="enemy" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Whenever you play some amount of cards, your turn ends and it gains 2 <span class="power-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Strength" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength"><img alt="Icon Strength.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/22px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/33px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Strength.png/44px-Icon_Strength.png?be60bf 2x" data-file-width="109" data-file-height="109" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Strength" title="Strength">Strength</a></span>.
</td>
<td>Playing 12 cards triggers this.
</td>
<td>Counter
</td>
<td>Unknown
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Unawakened.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Unawakened.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Unawakened.png/60px-Icon_Unawakened.png?162169" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Unawakened.png/90px-Icon_Unawakened.png?162169 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Unawakened.png/120px-Icon_Unawakened.png?162169 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Unawakened</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="enemy"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Awakened One" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Awakened_One#Awakened_One" title="Awakened One"><img alt="Map-Awakened.png" src="/images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/22px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/33px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f 1.5x, /images/thumb/Map-Awakened.png/44px-Map-Awakened.png?bfea9f 2x" data-file-width="512" data-file-height="512" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Awakened_One#Awakened_One" title="Awakened One">Awakened One</a></span></span>
<span data-show="enemy" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>This enemy hasn't awakened yet...
</td>
<td>This is not foreshadowing at all.
</td>
<td>Does not stack
</td>
<td>Integer limit
</td></tr>
<tr>
<td><div class="center"><div class="floatnone"><a href="/wiki/File:Icon_Surrounded.png" class="image"><img alt="Icon Surrounded.png" src="/images/thumb/Icon_Surrounded.png/60px-Icon_Surrounded.png?a37856" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="60" height="60" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/Icon_Surrounded.png/90px-Icon_Surrounded.png?a37856 1.5x, /images/thumb/Icon_Surrounded.png/120px-Icon_Surrounded.png?a37856 2x" data-file-width="128" data-file-height="128" /></a></div></div>
</td>
<td style="text-align:center; font-weight:bold;">
<p><b>Surrounded</b>
</p>
</td>
<td>
<p><span data-text="all"><span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spire Shield" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Shield" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Spire Shield</a></span> and <span class="enemy-trigger inline-trigger" data-name="Spire Spear" data-sequel="1"><a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Spear" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear"><img alt="EliteClear.png" src="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/22px-EliteClear.png?9888cd" decoding="async" loading="lazy" width="22" height="22" style="vertical-align: middle" srcset="/images/thumb/EliteClear.png/33px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 1.5x, /images/thumb/EliteClear.png/44px-EliteClear.png?9888cd 2x" data-file-width="106" data-file-height="106" /></a> <a href="/wiki/Spire_Shield_and_Spire_Spear#Spire_Spear" title="Spire Shield and Spire Spear">Spire Spear</a></span></span>
<span data-show="all" style="display:none"></span>
</p>
</td>
<td>Receive 50% more damage if attacked from behind.
</td>
<td>
<p>Use targeting cards or potions to change your orientation.<br />
Rounding error from Surrounded can cause these enemies to deal slightly less damage than the intent shows, on specific damage numbers.
</p>
</td>
<td>Does not stack
</td>
<td>
</td></tr></tbody></table>
